---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Privacy policy | tevsys',
  description:
    'tevsys privacy policy: contact-form data, web analytics, GDPR rights and legal review.',
};
---

<Layout seo={seo} lang="en">
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      This policy describes how we process personal data on the <strong>tevsys.io</strong> website and related
      channels (e.g. email). It does not describe processing inside MetaTrader 5 on your own terminal (local
      product logs), unless you voluntarily send us files or screenshots.
    </p>

    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      tevsys™, based in Barcelona (Spain). Contact:
      <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Full identifying details of the controller (name or company name, tax ID and address) will be
      formalized with professional legal advice, in line with the
      <a href="/en/company/legal">Legal notice</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted"><strong>1. Contact form and requests</strong></p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      When you use the contact form (demo, plans, audit or other enquiries), we collect the data you provide
      voluntarily: at least a name or identifier, email address and message. If the URL includes context
      parameters (e.g. plan or flow), those may be associated with your request so we can reply better.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted"><strong>2. Email</strong></p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      If you write to <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>, we process the address and message
      content to handle the conversation.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted"><strong>3. Web analytics (Vercel Web Analytics)</strong></p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      We use <strong>Vercel Web Analytics</strong> on this site for aggregated traffic insights (e.g. page
      views, approximate visitors, top pages, referrers). It is product/website analytics, not behavioural
      advertising. We do not sell that data to third parties for advertising.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Site administrators may disable event sending in their browser (internal technical opt-out). That does
      not change the processing described for other visitors.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted"><strong>4. Hosting technical data</strong></p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      The hosting provider (e.g. Vercel) may automatically log usual connection data (IP address, date/time,
      requested resource, user agent) in server logs, needed for security, stability and diagnostics. Those
      logs are managed under the provider’s terms.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted"><strong>5. Embedded third-party content</strong></p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Some pages may embed videos or other content hosted by third parties (e.g. YouTube). Playing them may
      involve processing under those platforms’ own policies. Please review them if you use those features.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted"><strong>6. Purchase / licence (when the channel is active)</strong></p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      If you buy or request a licence through a web payment channel (when enabled), the payment processor
      may process billing data and email under its terms. MetaQuotes Market, if you buy there, processes data
      under MetaQuotes’ rules; tevsys does not control that processing.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      We do <strong>not</strong> ask for card details on our contact form.
    </p>

    <h2>Purpose and legal basis</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      We use contact-form and email data to answer enquiries, manage demos or access requests and communicate
      what is needed about the product. The usual basis is your request (pre-contractual / consent when you
      send us data) and, where applicable, legitimate interest in handling the commercial relationship.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Aggregated analytics is used to improve the site and understand which content is viewed. The exact
      legal characterisation of that basis will be formalized with counsel (legitimate interest and/or
      consent depending on the final design).
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      We do not use your contact data to sell lists to third parties or for spam unrelated to the product.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      We keep messages and contact data for as long as needed for the purpose (handling the enquiry and
      reasonable follow-up) or while a product-related interest relationship exists, unless you request
      erasure sooner or law requires another period. Exact retention periods will be set with legal advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Recipients</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Providers may process data on our behalf or as independent controllers depending on the service: web
      hosting (e.g. Vercel), transactional or support email if applicable, and payment processors when web
      checkout is active. We do not hand your contact list to advertisers.
    </p>

    <h2>Rights</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      You may exercise rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction of processing and
      portability (where applicable) by writing to
      <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the competent
      supervisory authority (in Spain, the Agencia Española de Protección de Datos — AEPD).
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      The site and product are not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect children’s data.
    </p>

    <h2>Legal review</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      This policy reflects the current site with operational honesty. It will be expanded and adapted to
      GDPR / Spanish data-protection law with professional legal advice (full controller details, legal
      bases, retention periods and, if required, a cookie banner). For any enquiry:
      <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="legal-update">Last updated: 26 September 2026</p>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-update {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
